  (text "PSU: existing 30 V / 10 A bench supply, no CC/CV. F101 + D101 (TVS) protect against overvoltage and reverse polarity (D101 conducts, F101 blows)."
    (at 25 178.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid fea2f1dd-156e-4b03-bbd7-653b0c0e16ad))
  (text "J102: 12 V buck module XL4016 (8 A) for Peltiers (~3 A), relays and fans.   J103: 5 V buck module (MP1584) for Blue Pill, comparators and BTS7960 logic."
    (at 25 182.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 3b693b47-bd64-45b7-b51b-f673ddbbd531))
  (text "+3V3 comes from the Blue Pill regulator (MCU sheet)."
    (at 25 187.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 89a2aad1-6748-405e-a20a-0035e91050ec))
  (text "J104: bimetal thermostat KSD9700, normally closed, 60 C, mounted on the load heatsink. It cuts +12V_SW (relay coils + Peltier driver) independently of firmware."
    (at 25 191.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid dbec5b33-3914-4491-ba69-7b2e6853eca9))
  (text "Fuses: mini blade (ATM) fuses in Keystone 3568 PCB holders. H101-H104: M3 mounting holes."
    (at 25 196.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid f0159070-0c22-4e2c-a58c-824221787b65)))
